            "paragraph": "Subsequently, the model is initialised using the hyperparameters specified in Table 2, adopting an encoder-decoder architecture (Hinton and Salakhutdinov, 2006; Goodfellow et al., 2016). This architecture first compresses the highdimensional predictor field into a low-dimensional latent representation and then reconstructs the target field from that embedding.",
