            "paragraph": "The interplay with other climate modes, including the Atlantic Multidecadal Oscillation (AMO) and the Pacific Decadal Oscillation (PDO), contributes to the non-stationarity of this teleconnection and, consequently, to the varying influence of ENSO on European precipitation over time (L\u00f3pez-Parages and Rodr\u00edguez-Fonseca, 2012).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
